<bgrct x="0" y="358" w="26" h="11"/></label><label labelid="12" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="11" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="63" y="363"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;New Caption&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;kilómetros&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="59" y="364" w="57" h="11"/></label><label labelid="20" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="11" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="81" y="353"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;New Caption&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;millas&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="77" y="354" w="35" h="11"/></label><label labelid="21" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="10" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="486" y="323"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body/><title>&lt;html&gt;New Caption&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="0" width="0" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Santa María&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="482" y="324" w="68" h="13"/></label><label labelid="14" action="static" usepicon="0" useleader="0" textbuttonstyleid="12" usehotarea="0" locklabel="0"><pos x="10" y="380"/><leaderline/><caption titlestyleid="1" bodystyleid="2"><body/><title/><image/><imagerefid/></caption><audiofile/><hotarea/><labeltarget/><picon height="20" width="20" showwireframe="0" showimage="0" colorid="2"><pos x="0" y="0"/><altimage/><altimagerefid/></picon><labeltext>&lt;html&gt;Si haces clic sobre las fechas, encontrarás más información.&lt;/html&gt;</labeltext><audiorefid/><bgrct x="6" y="381" w="385" h="16"/></label></labels><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>380</imageheight><imagewidth>556</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;El primer viaje de Colón&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="2" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;Los tres barcos de Colón, &lt;i&gt;Pinta, Niña,&lt;/i&gt; y &lt;i&gt;Santa María&lt;/i&gt;, zarpan del puerto de Palos de la Frontera.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;3 de agosto de 1492&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00127575_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>182</imageheight><imagewidth>1</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;3 de agosto de 1492&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="3" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;Colón y su tripulación desembarcan en una isla americana. La llamaron San Salvador.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;12 de octubre de 1492&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00127575_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>182</imageheight><imagewidth>1</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;12 de octubre de 1492&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="4" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;La &lt;i&gt;Niña&lt;/i&gt; y la &lt;i&gt;Pinta&lt;/i&gt; inician el regreso a España. Colón viaja a bordo de la &lt;i&gt;Niña&lt;/i&gt;, porque la &lt;i&gt;Santa María&lt;/i&gt; había encallado.&lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;18 de enero de 1493&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00127575_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>182</imageheight><imagewidth>1</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;18 de enero de 1493&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide></slide><slide type="popup" slideid="5" sequence="5"><standardslide locklabelson="1" showtextarea="1" useshowhidelabels="0" lockpicon="0" useswfctrl="0" vrslide="0"><caption titlestyleid="3" bodystyleid="4"><body>&lt;html&gt;La &lt;i&gt;Niña&lt;/i&gt; y la &lt;i&gt;Pinta&lt;/i&gt; se separan tras una terrible tormenta. Ambas carabelas llegaron a Palos de la Frontera el 15 de marzo de 1493. &lt;/html&gt;</body><title>&lt;html&gt;13-14 de febrero de 1493&lt;/html&gt;</title><image/><imagerefid/></caption><image>00127575_1.jpg</image><audiofile/><labels/><keywords/><imagerefid/><audiorefid/><imageheight>182</imageheight><imagewidth>1</imagewidth><listtitle>&lt;html&gt;13-14 de febrero de 1493&lt;/html&gt;</listtitle><hidelbltext>&lt;html&gt;Ocultar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</hidelbltext><showlbltext>&lt;html&gt;Mostrar etiquetas&lt;/html&gt;</showlbltext></standardslide><